---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Us and Our History | Antares Systems"
  description="From import trade to business IT to business finance: how Antares Systems grew, and the corporate finance experience behind our business finance work."
  type="AboutPage"
  crumb="History"
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>Our history</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="prose history">
        <p>Antares began as an import business, supplying vehicles and equipment to the UK market. Working in trade taught us how purchases are funded, how buyers and suppliers manage credit, and how much depends on cash flow.</p>
        <p>We then moved into business IT, offering office technology solutions and buyback of surplus equipment to UK businesses, with documented data erasure.</p>
        <p>Our focus now is business finance. Our director brings more than ten years' experience in corporate finance within a large industrial holding group, a leader in its sectors. There he organised the raising and servicing of corporate debt across more than 50 companies. The work included negotiating with banks, setting group credit limits and managing debt service.</p>
        <p>We now use that experience to help UK businesses prepare their funding requests and reach the right lenders through our partner network.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
